ASSISTANT: The closest thing to cloning you is building a **personal AI agent** — give it your context, connect it to your apps, and it reasons and acts on your behalf. It can handle messages, triage your inbox, follow up on deals, draft in your voice, and take action across your tools — on demand or automatically.

Which direction sounds most useful to you?
ASSISTANT: Which of those resonates most — or tell me what you spend the most time on that you'd love to hand off, and I'll build your clone around that!
ASSISTANT: Pick whichever tile fits best, or just tell me — what's the one thing eating most of your time right now? I'll build your AI clone around that.
